			{{"That drop pod is still connected\342\200\224let's go check it out.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_OLIV_AIRSHIP_POD_DROPPED_MD"}, 0x30FC1F239B8DAB6Aull},
			{{"The Soviets\342\200\224our allies\342\200\224are dying out there. Hurry!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_OLIV_RADIO_CODE_NAG_HI"}, 0x9A09941EF4B5F829ull},
			{{"The Soviets\342\200\224our allies\342\200\224are dying out there. Hurry!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_OLIV_RADIO_CODE_NAG_LO"}, 0x9A09941EF4B5F829ull},
			{{"The Soviets\342\200\224our allies\342\200\224are dying out there. Hurry!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_OLIV_RADIO_CODE_NAG_MD"}, 0x9A09941EF4B5F829ull},
			{{"Roger that! We've got to find some way to draw that ship towards us. Maybe there are some flares in the supply crates around here.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_OLIV_RADIO_CONVERSATION_END_HI"}, 0x6B18BF4B21D8FFC8ull},
			{{"Roger that! We've got to find some way to draw that ship towards us. Maybe there are some flares in the supply crates around here.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_OLIV_RADIO_CONVERSATION_END_LO"}, 0x6B18BF4B21D8FFC8ull},
			{{"Roger that! We've got to find some way to draw that ship towards us. Maybe there are some flares in the supply crates around here.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_OLIV_RADIO_CONVERSATION_END_MD"}, 0x6B18BF4B21D8FFC8ull},
			{{"This... some sort of Soviet code... we might need this. Let's keep looking for that radio frequency.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_OLIV_RADIO_PASSPHRASE_DISCOVERY_HI"}, 0x764DF910F013BE4Aull},
			{{"This... some sort of Soviet code... we might need this. Let's keep looking for that radio frequency.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_OLIV_RADIO_PASSPHRASE_DISCOVERY_LO"}, 0x764DF910F013BE4Aull},
			{{"This... some sort of Soviet code... we might need this. Let's keep looking for that radio frequency.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_OLIV_RADIO_PASSPHRASE_DISCOVERY_MD"}, 0x764DF910F013BE4Aull},
			{{"These consoles\342\200\224we can use them to reroute the power!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_OLIV_STRAUB_CONSOLE_HI"}, 0x423F2CAB4F117CB4ull},
			{{"These consoles\342\200\224we can use them to reroute the power!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_OLIV_STRAUB_CONSOLE_LO"}, 0x423F2CAB4F117CB4ull},
			{{"These consoles\342\200\224we can use them to reroute the power!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_OLIV_STRAUB_CONSOLE_MD"}, 0x423F2CAB4F117CB4ull},
			{{"It has to be now... Now we are armed. Now we are angry. Straub dies today.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_OLIV_STRAUB_ESTABLISH_HI"}, 0x162B03B2A1C9A2DFull},
			{{"It has to be now... Now we are armed. Now we are angry. Straub dies today.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_OLIV_STRAUB_ESTABLISH_LO"}, 0x162B03B2A1C9A2DFull},
			{{"It has to be now... Now we are armed. Now we are angry. Straub dies today.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_OLIV_STRAUB_ESTABLISH_MD"}, 0x162B03B2A1C9A2DFull},
			{{"Did you count the zeppelins? There were... so many.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_OLIV_WAVEBREAK_AIRSHIPS_LO"}, 0xAB24D1AF9457C734ull},
			{{"This was... not how I foresaw things. The ravens still circle. But their time comes to a close.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_STRA_STRAUB_DEATH"}, 0x69C779FFBDEE622Bull},
			{{"Even now, my Untoten push back against the Russian invaders. Even now, our F\303\274hrer has found his way to freedom. Rejoice!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_STRA_STRAUB_DROP_POD_3"}, 0x4B26BA9A6063088Aull},
			{{"Even now, my Untoten push back against the Russian invaders. Even now, our F\303\274hrer has found his way to freedom. Rejoice!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_STRA_STRAUB_DROP_POD_ALT_3"}, 0x4B26BA9A6063088Aull},
			{{"Ha, you have only succeeded in bringing me into range. I have something... special prepared for you.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_STRA_STRAUB_TETHER_DONE_REACT"}, 0x7FC9A279EB2B1621ull},
			{{"Ha, you have only succeeded in bringing me into range. I have something... special prepared for you.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_STRA_STRAUB_TETHER_DONE_REACT_ALT"}, 0x7FC9A279EB2B1621ull},
			{{"You think you can bring down my Zeppelin? Your allies had success against a prototype in Mittelburg. Now you are dealing with a finished weapon. This was Richter's one triumph. It is why I keep his head as a trophy.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_STRA_STRAUB_TETHER_START_REACT"}, 0x8BF400A98C74D8B1ull},
			{{"You think you can bring down my Zeppelin? Your allies had success against a prototype in Mittelburg. Now you are dealing with a finished weapon. This was Richter's one triumph. It is why I keep his head as a trophy.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_STRA_STRAUB_TETHER_START_REACT_ALT"}, 0x8BF400A98C74D8B1ull},
			{{"This must be fate. Our destinies are intertwined... and now I understand why: finally, I get to witness your demise.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_STRA_STRAUB_TRAP_REACT_1"}, 0x6F247BFACEBB19E8ull},
			{{"Yes, yes\342\200\224Mittelburg was a complete loss. But I had already moved most of my\342\200\224most of the soldiers to our storage facilities by the time the Allied agents arrived. And our island fortress. Heligoland. It served its purpose as well. Yes, the loss of equipment, of materials, the thousands of pristine corpses... and the Hilt! These things have weighed on me. Heavily. But we have other facilities. Other plans. I have been... meticulous. Oh, and I have made sure to extend my thanks to those that I feel were responsible for these losses. But this must all be taken in scope of the grander picture. The vanguard of the Final Reich has taken wing, and clouds of doom hang over the Allied forces. And when our enemies look into the sky, as the shadow falls across their faces... they'll see me, staring back at them.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_STRA_VIDLOG1_1"}, 0x8AAB88639D3483D1ull},
			{{"Learn from your losses, and they become victories. This is true in research, and it is true in war. Mittelburg and Heligoland were good lessons. Our excitement in discovering the Geistkraft energy made us reliant on it. It became our Achilles heel. The Hilt allowed us to bring the dead back to life. It provided the catalyst. Now we can take what Barbarossa has given us and build it into something greater. Now we can apply German thought. German engineering. German power! A power that shall shake the world!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_STRA_VIDLOG2_1"}, 0x3DF7D81B1A667727ull},
			{{"I received a call from the F\303\274hrer himself. The Russians are moving into Berlin, filthy barbarians... they are burning the one-time Kingdom of Prussia, the Weimar Republic, and the throne of the Third Reich. They know not what they do. They know. Not. What. They. Do! They have forced my hand. And now they will be pulled apart by the claws of my Untoten. Every... everyone in the city shall die. Horribly. Horribly! The F\303\274hrer has already left the city, and now it is my job to cleanse it of this infection. Those loyal to the dream of our leader will understand. Someday... Someday they will understand.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BERLIN_ZMB_BERL_STRA_VIDLOG3_1"}, 0xDFACABE9BAFC107Aull},
			{{"Priority zero\342\200\224stop the bomber!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_DLC3_GLOBAL_ZMB_DLC3_GBL_BATA_PRIORITYZEROSTOPTHEBOMBER"}, 0xC909EE977E72FA3Full},
			{{"This is not complicated, people. Take 'em down!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_DLC3_GLOBAL_ZMB_DLC3_GBL_JEFF_THISISNOTCOMPLICATEDPEOPL"}, 0xD72C7B9D008D9E2Eull},
			{{"Goddamn... this is a modified engine from one of Richter's Geistkraft transmission devices. But it's been set to cycle the ambient energy back into itself until molecular dissociation.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_DLC3_GLOBAL_ZMB_DLC3_GBL_MARI_GODDAMNTHISISAMODIFIEDENG"}, 0x9558F12C787F9CA5ull},
			{{"They've been charged with whatever sick form of Geistkraft exists down here.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_DLC3_GLOBAL_ZMB_DLC3_GBL_OLIV_THEYVEBEENCHARGEDWITHWHAT"}, 0x514D6DDFDB7FBC22ull},
			{{"German and Russian lines are broken and scattered along the eastern front. The F\303\274hrer has a tiger by the tail, and his grip is slowly, inevitably slipping. Meanwhile, the Bureau is taking aim right between its yellow eyes. Unified support from the Allied forces has enabled us to push back, to make surgical strikes against a regime that is falling into chaos and madness.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_DLC3_GLOBAL_ZMB_DLC3_GBL_RIDE_AUDIOLOG_2"}, 0xA8018F70F4EBF444ull},
			{{"Our core team of four was able to liberate the first Elektroschnalle devices, and we have been able to build our own improvements. The science of Geistkraft has been task numero uno for our boys down in Los Alamos, who have been reassigned from... other tasks. Agent Marie Fischer has been instrumental in helping them unravel this mess. The discoveries they have been making... they are frightening. Astounding.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_DLC3_GLOBAL_ZMB_DLC3_GBL_RIDE_AUDIOLOG_4"}, 0xBABC7BD00B4919ACull},
			{{"In spite of these discoveries, our attempts to combine the three parts of Barbarossa's sword have failed. No amount of pressure, heat, or molten steel will match them. Ms. Fischer claimed that the sword's base material is a magnetic monopole, which evoked laughter from Robert\342\200\224our Harvard boy and head physicist. This resulted in... a black eye for him and several apologies for her.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_DLC3_GLOBAL_ZMB_DLC3_GBL_RIDE_AUDIOLOG_5"}, 0x095BE9E26DE5E41Aull},
			{{"Marie has quickly gained a grudging respect from our pencil pushers here. Her insights into Straub's work, combined with her brother's notes, have challenged everything we thought we knew about the atom. Our only conclusion, backed by Professor Hynd's research, is that the sword must be taken to Thule to be reforged. That's all well and good, apart from the fact that Thule is an imaginary fairyland invented by a bunch of drunk medieval cartographers.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_DLC3_GLOBAL_ZMB_DLC3_GBL_RIDE_AUDIOLOG_6"}, 0x55FFF2174BE83EE6ull},
			{{"Except, maybe it isn't. At least Himmler and his boys at the Ahnenerbe seemed to think it was real. We've tracked Nazi search parties to Greenland, South America, and Antarctica\342\200\224all hunting for this prehistoric Hyperborea, the origin of the Aryan race. It was our discoveries during Operation Highjump that pointed to increased Nazi activity in New Swabia.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_DLC3_GLOBAL_ZMB_DLC3_GBL_RIDE_AUDIOLOG_7"}, 0x3BFC7323BAAB05D0ull},
			{{"Let's get these holes repaired!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_SHIP_ZMB_BP_SHIP_BATA_LETSGETTHESEHOLESREPAIRED"}, 0xD159D3FF09D17F54ull},
			{{"I've divided the artifacts amongst the convoy, and we have agents stationed to guard each of them. But this ship is the only one with our coordinates\342\200\224it's a security measure.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_SHIP_ZMB_BP_SHIP_RIDE_IVEDIVIDEDTHEARTIFACTSAMO"}, 0xE3CAE83BECE310DDull},
			{{"Looks like Mikhail and Del Toro were able to hold their own. OK, Ensign, let's\342\200\224", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_SHIP_ZMB_BP_SHIP_RIDE_LOOKSLIKEMIKHAILANDDELTOR"}, 0x173AD6417DFA4F59ull},
			{{"The bastards can't drown\342\200\224the Nazis figure their soldiers can just waltz out with the artifacts once we've sunk!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_SHIP_ZMB_BP_SHIP_RIDE_THEBASTARDSCANTDROWNTHENA"}, 0x2CE1F87D733551CAull},
			{{"Watch your language... Captain Nguyen.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_SHIP_ZMB_BP_SHIP_RIDE_WATCHYOURLANGUAGECAPTAINN"}, 0xACF0EF0E99A63371ull},
			{{"The lights\342\200\224just beyond the fog! Sir, our friends have repelled the invaders!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_SHIP_ZMB_BP_SHIP_SLAY_THELIGHTSJUSTBEYONDTHEFOG"}, 0xEC4D556AC435B2EBull},
			{{"I hear movement in the waters\342\200\224ship engines.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_SHIP_ZMB_BP_SHIP_SURV_IHEARMOVEMENTINTHEWATERSS"}, 0x760E852ADE3F4877ull},
			{{"No. Those are German U-boats. We need to get to the guns.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_SHIP_ZMB_BP_SHIP_SURV_NOTHOSEAREGERMANUBOATSWEN"}, 0x65D0F904BE555EFEull},
			{{"We've got the ship systems fired up\342\200\224should be ready to move out soon. Shall I send a boat out to the other ships?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_SHIP_ZMB_BP_SHIP_SURV_WEVEGOTTHESHIPSYSTEMSFIRE"}, 0x3AA2DFEBC9140B6Eull},
			{{"In a moment, mate. Did you see this\342\200\224", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_THULE_ZMB_BP_THULE_DROS_INAMOMENTMATEDIDYOUSEETHI"}, 0x4EDB5D5D57D0290Eull},
			{{"Well, I... you know what? I think I'd like that. I'd like that a lot, sir.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_THULE_ZMB_BP_THULE_DROS_WELLIYOUKNOWWHATITHINKIDL"}, 0x27DE15A290B55728ull},
			{{"Dumb luck, brother. El Guettar. Tunisia. My unit got sent in to torch a bunker, but the place was a Nazi stash. Cellar full of late Renaissance work.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_THULE_ZMB_BP_THULE_JEFF_DUMBLUCKBROTHERELGUETTART"}, 0x54EE15C59F31668Aull},
			{{"Formally? No. My father worked security at Fulbright down in Fayetteville. Graveyard shift. Nobody was home to watch me, so I got dumped at the library every night and read myself to sleep.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_THULE_ZMB_BP_THULE_JEFF_FORMALLYNOMYFATHERWORKEDS"}, 0x47BF01BF102BBA2Full},
			{{"Ha, well that's a nice French word for \"complicated son of a bitch,\" but I appreciate it. Merci.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_THULE_ZMB_BP_THULE_JEFF_HAWELLTHATSANICEFRENCHWOR"}, 0xC40F478FC2CAF64Aull},
			{{"Is that it? The pieces all assembled? That was... that was too easy.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_THULE_ZMB_BP_THULE_JEFF_ISTHATITTHEPIECESALLASSEM"}, 0x6AD9C20C93638EC2ull},
			{{"OK, let's keep it together. We've been through worse shit than this before.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_THULE_ZMB_BP_THULE_JEFF_OKLETSKEEPITTOGETHERWEVEB"}, 0x0E2EA0DEAB0966F6ull},
			{{"The Old Testament. Genesis and Numbers. It mentions a time when giants walked the earth.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_THULE_ZMB_BP_THULE_JEFF_THEOLDTESTAMENTGENESISAND"}, 0xAA10267F2B337C96ull},
			{{"These plates on the ground... they mean something!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_THULE_ZMB_BP_THULE_JEFF_THESEPLATESONTHEGROUNDTHE"}, 0xEDA39224B960FEF8ull},
			{{"This place is coming down\342\200\224we've got to move.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_THULE_ZMB_BP_THULE_JEFF_THISPLACEISCOMINGDOWNWEVE"}, 0x735BF99D6F12FAA2ull},
			{{"It looked like... a man. A young man.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_THULE_ZMB_BP_THULE_MARI_ITLOOKEDLIKEAMANAYOUNGMAN"}, 0x05E8820CC339060Bull},
			{{"This race... tall, pale, and powerful. They must have seems like monsters to our ancestors.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_THULE_ZMB_BP_THULE_MARI_THISRACETALLANDPOWERFULAN_ALT"}, 0xAA0F0E1A9F24FDA9ull},
			{{"We are not alone here. We... are not... alone.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_THULE_ZMB_BP_THULE_MARI_WEARENOTALONEHEREWEARENOT"}, 0xEC0CD2586EEF7EE7ull},
			{{"We still don't know what the sword can do. I think we should just destroy the thing. It only brings misery.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_THULE_ZMB_BP_THULE_MARI_WESTILLDONTKNOWWHATTHESWO"}, 0x7E736C82C0AC728Dull},
			{{"Yes, I find conversation keeps me from brooding. Keeps me sharp. I was listening earlier\342\200\224you don't have any academic training?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_THULE_ZMB_BP_THULE_MARI_YESIFINDCONVERSATIONKEEPS"}, 0x2487A3F1C597B466ull},
			{{"I can feel it too, Jefferson. We were supposed to bring the sword here... and leave it.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_THULE_ZMB_BP_THULE_OLIV_ICANFEELITTOOJEFFERSONWEW"}, 0x2BC25DFB924C7791ull},
			{{"This chamber... it feels just like the room where we found the Hilt!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_THULE_ZMB_BP_THULE_OLIV_THISCHAMBERITFEELSJUSTLIK"}, 0x27D00C083AD90A94ull},
			{{"It must have an \303\234berschnalle built into its chassis. It's like... a bloody power plant!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_WINDMILL_ZMB_BP_WIND_BATA_ITMUSTHAVEANUBERSCHNALLEB"}, 0x13EEAEA1FAA44B01ull},
			{{"Saburov! Del Toro! On me!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_WINDMILL_ZMB_BP_WIND_BATA_SABUROVDELTOROONME"}, 0xA4E201F4A560C503ull},
			{{"This could take hours, Sir. We don't have the tools to\342\200\224", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_WINDMILL_ZMB_BP_WIND_BATA_THISCOULDTAKEHOURSSIRWEDO"}, 0xDBF6CA998A52FC54ull},
			{{"Si, General. They... they burn through my home as well. You learn to spot them in the smoke. You learn or you die.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_WINDMILL_ZMB_BP_WIND_HUNT_SIGENERALTHEYTHEYBURNTHRO"}, 0x66A23B09F90FEC56ull},
			{{"It's... just a feeling, General. An instinct. I can still smell rot on the wind. We need somebody up in that tower.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_WINDMILL_ZMB_BP_WIND_MOUNT_ITSJUSTAFEELINGGENERALANI"}, 0x86317E08C613BA05ull},
			{{"Alright, let's get on the road. I'm done jousting with Spanish windmills.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_WINDMILL_ZMB_BP_WIND_RIDE_ALRIGHTLETSGETONTHEROADIM"}, 0x1430F70AC8A8608Full},
			{{"Del Toro! This storm... is this normal for the region?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_WINDMILL_ZMB_BP_WIND_RIDE_DELTOROTHISSTORMISTHISNOR"}, 0xCC448D1B8D5C0048ull},
			{{"In case you're wondering, this is why we didn't book a plane, Harris.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_WINDMILL_ZMB_BP_WIND_RIDE_INCASEYOUREWONDERINGTHISI"}, 0xEF18F875F9AADFC1ull},
			{{"Must be that damn \"Geistkraft\" Straub uses to power his trinkets. Alright... alright... well, let's start looking for replacement parts.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_WINDMILL_ZMB_BP_WIND_RIDE_MUSTBETHATDAMNGEISTKRAFTS"}, 0x668053B7C2914F78ull},
			{{"So our caravan made it out of Germany into France, but... well, what's French for \"our asses just dropped out of a Nazi frying pan and into the fire\"?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_WINDMILL_ZMB_BP_WIND_RIDE_SOOURCARAVANMADEITOUTOFGE"}, 0x2FBA8636A5BECD8Aull},
			{{"The Brenner has been modified\342\200\224it has some kind of gravity shield. Like the Hilt back in Mittelburg.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_WINDMILL_ZMB_BP_WIND_RIDE_THEBRENNERHASBEENMODIFIED"}, 0x7823ED5EBBB5B5D1ull},
			{{"Well done. Hurry now\342\200\224let's get loaded up and back on the road\342\200\224it's a long drive to Malaga.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_WINDMILL_ZMB_BP_WIND_RIDE_WELLDONEHURRYNOWLETSGETLO"}, 0xBE2FF8B7CF94FFF4ull},
			{{"Yeah, well... thanks for not rubbing it in, Harris. We're down a soldier, but I've sent out a call to our allies at the checkpoint. They should be sending\342\200\224", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_WINDMILL_ZMB_BP_WIND_RIDE_YEAHWELLTHANKSFORNOTRUBBI"}, 0x2716B735CDA154C5ull},
			{{"You may be more right than you know, Private. We are carrying some... powerful elements with us.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_WINDMILL_ZMB_BP_WIND_RIDE_YOUMAYBEMORERIGHTTHANYOUK"}, 0x53EF084D7BE265E9ull},
			{{"The storm, she is rising. We must move quickly!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_BP_WINDMILL_ZMB_BP_WIND_SLAY_THESTORMSHEISRISINGWEMOST"}, 0x1A2DF28D3F086BCCull},
			{{"Feeling... powerful...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_DLC_GLOBAL2_ZMB_DLC_GBL2_HUNT_BLITZPUNCH_HI"}, 0x39EBBD6180F474B7ull},
			{{"Feeling... powerful...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_DLC_GLOBAL2_ZMB_DLC_GBL2_HUNT_BLITZPUNCH_LO"}, 0x39EBBD6180F474B7ull},
			{{"Feeling... powerful...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_DLC_GLOBAL2_ZMB_DLC_GBL2_HUNT_BLITZPUNCH_MD"}, 0x39EBBD6180F474B7ull},
			{{"No me veas!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_DLC_GLOBAL2_ZMB_DLC_GBL2_HUNT_CAMOUFLAGE2_HI"}, 0xF53BFAE35736BE49ull},
			{{"No me veas!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_DLC_GLOBAL2_ZMB_DLC_GBL2_HUNT_CAMOUFLAGE2_LO"}, 0xF53BFAE35736BE49ull},
			{{"No me veas!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_DLC_GLOBAL2_ZMB_DLC_GBL2_HUNT_CAMOUFLAGE2_MD"}, 0xF53BFAE35736BE49ull},
			{{"Soy sombra!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_DLC_GLOBAL2_ZMB_DLC_GBL2_HUNT_CAMOUFLAGE3_HI"}, 0x5380187784ACCD4Aull},
			{{"Soy sombra!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_DLC_GLOBAL2_ZMB_DLC_GBL2_HUNT_CAMOUFLAGE3_LO"}, 0x5380187784ACCD4Aull},
			{{"Soy sombra!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_DLC_GLOBAL2_ZMB_DLC_GBL2_HUNT_CAMOUFLAGE3_MD"}, 0x5380187784ACCD4Aull},
			{{"They can't see you... go!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_DLC_GLOBAL2_ZMB_DLC_GBL2_HUNT_COVERTEXFILTRATION2_HI"}, 0x5616D9FBA04A32A1ull},
