			{{"Hurry! Don't lose it!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_DLC_GLOBAL_ZMB_DLC_GBL_OLIV_TREASUREZOMBIEWARN_MD"}, 0x699561780E611348ull},
			{{"Gah. Now you're going to say that the Egyptian idea of mummies and gods of death is all... oh. Oh.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_DROS_GAHNOWYOUREGOINGTOSAYTHAT"}, 0xD90C65CB95E07DACull},
			{{"This... this is not what I wanted. I am not in control. I am not... No! Get out of my mind!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_GDK_THISTHISISNOTWHATIWANTEDI"}, 0x3A1BE497262389C6ull},
			{{"Your pain. Your blood. Your terror. Delicious. Dance, puppets\342\200\224you have fulfilled your role. Dance for me, one last time.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_GDK_YOURPAINYOURBLOODYOURTERR"}, 0x7FE50E3B232C22C4ull},
			{{"Blood seems to be drawn to this spot.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_JEFF_BLOODSEEMSTOBEDRAWNTOTHIS"}, 0xE7E78C4A97C06943ull},
			{{"That's not so strange. I taught comparative mythology for a few years back in Atlanta\342\200\224there are a few common thoughts, legends, and even architecture amongst primitive cultures.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_JEFF_THATSNOTSOSTRANGEITAUGHTC"}, 0x9C975A40ADFB6C97ull},
			{{"Those markings\342\200\224back at our last stop? They mentioned aqueducts, highways, tributes from the North. This wasn't some little outpost.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_JEFF_THOSEMARKINGSBACKATOURLAS"}, 0xBE7B157CFD1676ACull},
			{{"Well, it must have backfired\342\200\224took down their Stukas and a zeppelin. Any theories, Marie?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_JEFF_WELLITMUSTHAVEBACKFIREDTO"}, 0x010E621ECA19D3E8ull},
			{{"Blood... it ties all living things to the sea. The tide keeps time with our heartbeats.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_KLAU_BLOODITTIESALLLIVINGTHING"}, 0x29BD20D1EC460410ull},
			{{"By blood, by rage, by the raging tide\342\200\224the undead shall die by thy hand.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_KLAU_BYBLOODBYRAGEBYTHERAGINGT"}, 0x8F855255F98D9B0Aull},
			{{"Find the lords in the sky. They know all\342\200\224past, present, and future.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_KLAU_FINDTHELORDSINTHESKYTHEYK"}, 0x922AF357F7A31F50ull},
			{{"Harken\342\200\224the light and then the sound. The crash of warring skies.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_KLAU_HARKENTHELIGHTANDTHENTHES"}, 0x8A1C06A0782151C6ull},
			{{"I speak for An'heist, first of the Deathraven Order. Ender of paths. Son of Twilight. To him is due more rage, fire, and vengeance than any other\342\200\224Thule has stolen what is rightfully his.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_KLAU_ISPEAKFORANHIESTFIRSTOFTH"}, 0x71AF030DCF550683ull},
			{{"Patterns dissolve into chaos... and then become part of a greater pattern.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_KLAU_PATTERNSDISSOLVEINTOCHAOS"}, 0x36AC81866F6DF983ull},
			{{"Spilt blood is a divine gift\342\200\224so has it always been.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_KLAU_SPILTBLOODISADIVINEGIFTSO"}, 0x4AE73157462E0360ull},
			{{"Dear god\342\200\224did they travel this way? The pain of being torn apart and rebuilt... who were these people?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_MARI_DEARGODDIDTHEYTRAVELTHISW"}, 0x2455D4E056D6D273ull},
			{{"I saw fire... and then we were falling. Was it some new Nazi weapon?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_OLIV_ISAWFIREANDTHENWEWEREFALL"}, 0x28FCFF37DCF718E2ull},
			{{"Not just one civilization. See the Assyrian stonework over there? The Harappan framework, just like we found in the Mohenjo-daro ruins?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_OLIV_NOTJUSTONECIVILIZATIONSEE"}, 0x8AD85BBC48585178ull},
			{{"This is baked limestone from the Yucat\303\241n. Archaic Mayan work.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_OLIV_THISISBAKEDLIMESTONEFROMT"}, 0x7C8CF80D93973B52ull},
			{{"Whatever it was ripped through our plane\342\200\224and the Nazi fleet\342\200\224like paper.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_OLIV_WHATEVERITWASRIPPEDTHROUG"}, 0xA325F306B8B6FBFBull},
			{{"Yes, I could spend an entire day following my curiosity. Chasing questions through the endless hallways of the Louvre...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_OLIV_YESICOULDSPENDANENTIREDAY"}, 0x20C1CE863135A480ull},
			{{"Colonel, if you can read me\342\200\224keep an eye out for Agent Harris. She's betrayed us, and may be in your coordinates. Orders are to shoot on sight.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_RIDE_COLONELIFYOUCANREADMEKEEP"}, 0x0FA6A5B4B1325249ull},
			{{"Colonel Jefferson! Do you read me? Our scouting party has spotted your plane\342\200\224Jefferson! Do you read me?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_RIDE_COLONELJEFFERSONDOYOUREAD"}, 0x729D5284303EA642ull},
			{{"Colonel, we've recovered Captain Saburov and are headed in. I... I am sorry about Agent Harris. I know what you and your team have been through\342\200\224more than you know. I have been waiting for you\342\200\224we have been waiting. The Order of the Ravens welcomes you.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_RIDE_COLONELWEVERECOVEREDCAPTA"}, 0x79DB2FFACD6BCFD1ull},
			{{"Harris, you have no idea what you're doing! Harris! Harris! Gas up a Grumman and get me out there! Now!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_RIDE_HARRISYOUHAVENOIDEAWHATYO"}, 0xCE6D8B5E95AD55ABull},
			{{"I am here to guide you, as I have from the beginning. I need you up top now\342\200\224our forces are beginning to crumble. Arise, Raven Lords. The world needs you.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_RIDE_IAMHERETOGUIDEYOUASIHAVEF"}, 0x00BE02AB6DC46DADull},
			{{"This is a secure channel, Col. Jefferson. You, Marie, Olivia, and Drostan... You have been chosen for a grand purpose. A purpose that goes beyond any government, any nation, anything you've known before. You are here to bring balance to the cycle of life and death.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_RIDE_THISISASECURECHANNELCOLJE"}, 0x7F9CAFEA6683D474ull},
			{{"He must have the sword. It is his. His alone. His will be done. His will... Be done.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_VIVI_HEMUSTHAVETHESWORDITISHIS"}, 0x233A5E32B0636EE9ull},
			{{"He wanted to leave you... he wanted to... He wanted to just leave you and you need the sword. He needs the sword. He must have the sword...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_VIVI_HEWANTEDTOLEAVEYOUHEWANTE"}, 0x0671A27326A36974ull},
			{{"Negative, sir. Just spoke with Saburov\342\200\224turns out the Colonel and his team are still here. They need this sword.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_FROZEN_DAWN_ZMB_DLC4_FZN_DWN_VIVI_NEGATIVESIRJUSTSPOKEWITHS"}, 0xE62F02BFC536A103ull},
			{{"Aaaaa... Aaaaa... AAAAARRRGH!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_CGO_AAAAAAAAAAAAAAARRRGH"}, 0x690E9FE6997A5408ull},
			{{"Bitte... bitte befreit mich von dieser Qual. Ich habe nur Befehle befolgt.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_CGO_BITTEBITTEBEFREITMICHVOND"}, 0x6D3E614B2A38CE44ull},
			{{"And Straub, well he is furious. Furious and... terrified. Because they keep escaping and then coming back. They do not speak much, but one word is clear. Repeated over and over again. \"Mutter... Mutter\" It is how we say Mother.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_CGO_CONTDANDSTRAUBWELLHEISFUR"}, 0x68B76E97BCF2CDB3ull},
			{{"Even now he carries the head of Richter around on a stick... it is his personal key to areas of the island that I can no longer enter. This is... I cannot do this any longer. Please, send your people. Now.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_CGO_CONTDEVENNOWHECARRIESTHEH"}, 0x2543DA986C3408D9ull},
			{{"His recent experiments with reviving dead brain matter resulted in a more conscious member of his Untoten army.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_CGO_HISRECENTEXPERIMENTSWITHR"}, 0x3256E7F70D2217DDull},
			{{"I am not sure whether I should celebrate Straub's distraction or not, however. You see, the Meuchlers\342\200\224they have been escaping from storage. This should not be possible.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_CGO_IAMNOTSUREWHETHERISHOULDC"}, 0x5A3088D8EA33369Aull},
			{{"Ich hab euch doch geholfen.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_CGO_ICHHABEUCHDOCHGEHOLFEN"}, 0x3F6FF5E9C1285EC5ull},
			{{"Ravencrown, this is Red Riding Hood. Things have gotten moderately better here, due to an external distraction. Doktor Straub has lost a number of his Meuchlers... the undead soldiers he created as Assassins. They are... they are the most monstrous of Straub's rotten children. The most intelligent.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_CGO_RAVENCROWNTHISISREDRIDING"}, 0x10C30BF5FC264620ull},
			{{"This is Red Riding Hood, with a final message for Ravencrown. We have new orders, orders to abandon Operation Sea Lion. I overheard the message from Berlin. You must hurry! You must come\342\200\224come now! It was from our F\303\274hrer! He was begging for rescue!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_CGO_THISISREDRIDINGHOODWITHAF"}, 0x6971D6ABDA87D8D0ull},
			{{"Uh... uh... Was ist denn hier los?...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_CGO_UHUHWASISTDENNHIERLOS"}, 0xB2574FF8D46AD47Aull},
			{{"Your message has been received, and contingency plan Nine Red is now active. Thank you for your sacrifice.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_COMD_ALTYOURMESSAGEHASBEENRECE"}, 0xA280728028FFE62Cull},
			{{"If I could radio into the RAF, they could rain hellfire down on this island, and burn it back to the Stone Age. It's the only option.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_AIRSTRIKE_LO"}, 0x510E9B6A1130CE18ull},
			{{"If I could radio into the RAF, they could rain hellfire down on this island, and burn it back to the Stone Age. It's the only option.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_AIRSTRIKE_MD"}, 0x510E9B6A1130CE18ull},
			{{"\"A man who loves his work whistles with the sunrise.\" That's what gran used to say. See, I'm not some grubby pickpocket. I'm an... an active appreciator of the arts. And this scroll is a lovely piece of work.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_AMANWHOLOVESHISWORKWHISTL"}, 0x1709B67A320259DDull},
			{{"[Coughing from poison gas]", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_COUGHINGFROMPOISONGAS"}, 0x98A39DC3350B009Eull},
			{{"It wasn't my fault! I can only dig up what's been buried, mate\342\200\224what, I'm supposed to pull mummified knights out of me arse!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_DEFENSIVEITWASNTMYFAULTIC"}, 0x46AF57DE17220430ull},
			{{"Gah that's fucking twisted. Connect the dots\342\200\224and spinal cord\342\200\224to open the gate...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_EMPTYCORPSEGATE_LO"}, 0xC647FF108C191529ull},
			{{"Gah that's fucking twisted. Connect the dots\342\200\224and spinal cord\342\200\224to open the gate...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_EMPTYCORPSEGATE_MD"}, 0xC647FF108C191529ull},
			{{"Fine. Fine, ya all confessed to the priest, so I'll be straight with you. See, I've been here before.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_FINEFINEYAALLCONFESSEDTOT"}, 0xA142A051E12BD540ull},
			{{"Gun is too hot!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_FLAKHOT_HI"}, 0x23BF9E26FAD0A56Eull},
			{{"Gun is too hot!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_FLAKHOT_LO"}, 0x23BF9E26FAD0A56Eull},
			{{"Gun is too hot!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_FLAKHOT_MD"}, 0x23BF9E26FAD0A56Eull},
			{{"England is next on their list. I've heard of this... Operation Sea Lion. We have to stop them.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_FREEZER_LO"}, 0x2622DE152DBC6085ull},
			{{"England is next on their list. I've heard of this... Operation Sea Lion. We have to stop them.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_FREEZER_MD"}, 0x2622DE152DBC6085ull},
			{{"Wonderful illustration by our mad monk\342\200\224a really twisted drawing. Very Hieronymus Bosch. Pools of blood. Fiery swords. The fanatical daydreams of a lonely toss-pot.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_GOINGONABOUTTHEARTWONDERF"}, 0xA05E339B38785CEBull},
			{{"I agree with ya, love. But accidents happen all the time at sea. Our dear Nazi friend wouldn't be above putting a bullet in my head and then dumping me overboard\342\200\224might even save a few quid doing so. Yeah. So I put an extensive fortnight dig into the calendars, then booked my own passage out on a fishing boat that evening.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_IAGREEWITHYALOVEBUTACCIDE"}, 0x7B041F73FDC44483ull},
			{{"I don't know, mate. I'm... not sure that's entirely accurate anymore.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_IDONTKNOWMATEIMNOTSURETHA"}, 0x6BF22F330B77B615ull},
			{{"I found a lot of bones. Carvings from the 1st century AD, from the Germanic tribes.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_IFOUNDALOTOFBONESCARVINGS"}, 0x3A1118473F324483ull},
			{{"Keep yer wig on. I stole from Nazis\342\200\224which is what we're doin now. And I sold the scrolls to a museum. To the common folk. Would you talk this way to Robin Hood?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_KEEPYERWIGONISTOLEFROMNAZ"}, 0x7223430D1590F9D4ull},
			{{"... Need that firepower, now!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_MG42LOOK_BOTH"}, 0x4719F97F276EC868ull},
