			{{"This island is a bloody rat's den\342\200\224it's riddled with tunnels. First the pagans with their blood sacrifices... followed by every flavor of medieval religious fanatic, and now the Nazis\342\200\224centuries of shady people hiding their shady deeds.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_NAGSUBPEN_LO"}, 0x7ED6ECEA7181E391ull},
			{{"This island is a bloody rat's den\342\200\224it's riddled with tunnels. First the pagans with their blood sacrifice... followed by every flavor of medieval religious fanatic, and now the Nazis\342\200\224centuries of shady people hiding their shady deeds.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_NAGSUBPEN_MD"}, 0x681FDBDFBEA949EAull},
			{{"Not really. That's why I kept it to myself. But... but I've been thinking: This island is crawling with tunnels, caves, and hidden alcoves. Plenty of spots to hide away your secrets.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_NOTREALLYTHATSWHYIKEPTITT"}, 0xA6AD802D7C0364DCull},
			{{"Now just hold on, mate. This was before anybody knew what Hitler and his boys were up to. I was a history professor specializing in early medieval art... Himmler offered me a pretty pot to sail out here and muck about in the tunnels. Things were tight at the time, so I took the job. Didn't know I'd be working for ghouls.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_NOWJUSTHOLDONMATETHISWASB"}, 0xAFB6CADA07ACE85Bull},
			{{"Oh, so we're going to have ourselves a little heart-to-heart then? All cards on the table? Alright, then\342\200\224who is going first? Eh? Eh? Yeah, I didn't think so.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_OHSOWEREGOINGTOHAVEOURSEL"}, 0xE74D6FED0351CFD0ull},
			{{"Look at 'em\342\200\224they're in some kind of trance.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_DROS_PAGANASSASSIN_HI"}, 0xFFA1A54BF32D8048ull},
