			{{"We are almost finished here\342\200\224I have already moved all but the most essential personnel off of the island. The ships are loaded and moving out for Directive 16.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_STRA_WEAREALMOSTFINISHEDHEREIH"}, 0x09541ABCDD742DF7ull},
			{{"You and your \"allied\" comrades are like... like roaches. No common beliefs, no shared loyalties, just hungry vermin scuttling around in the trash. But... it is so much work to stomp you all out. Very hard to kill. This is impressive... disgusting, but impressive.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_STRA_YOUANDYOURALLIEDCOMRADESA"}, 0x9D52AFDD2A0D2AC4ull},
			{{"You have no idea what you are up against. I have stored enough Geistkraft energy to reanimate the Wehrmacht ten times over. The Allies can keep the verdammt Hilt\342\200\224regardless, those thieving cowards don't have the knowledge or courage to use it correctly.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_ISLAND_ZMB_ISLA_STRA_YOUHAVENOIDEAWHATYOUAREUP"}, 0x30BF16CF6A57ABE4ull},
			{{"Marie, if you are listening to this then you have received my letters. I pray to God that you are ok\342\200\224and that you come armed with the might of the Allied forces.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_AUDIO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_ALOGS_KLAU_LOG01"}, 0x171BC10CE15C5B47ull},
			{{"After I came home and took over our father's shop, I was angry. Furious. Having to leave my studies at Heidelberg to care for him had been bad enough. But my mentor, my idol, Professor Lenard\342\200\224the man responsible for the Deutsche Physik! He chose to retire in my absence. My dream of playing a role in the German scientific renaissance\342\200\224it was dead. I lost hope.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_AUDIO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_ALOGS_KLAU_LOG03"}, 0xEFC579926F6EF642ull},
			{{"It was I who sent a message to the Nazis. My contact at the University put me in touch with Richard Darr\303\251\342\200\224from there, it was only a matter of days before the Ahnenerbe rolled in with a full battalion of troops. I took Dr. Straub down to the chapel myself, showed him the hilt to the Barbarossa's sword. It was like touching a flame to gunpowder.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_AUDIO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_ALOGS_KLAU_LOG07"}, 0xCE891C5CF15E683Full},
			{{"The salt mines were converted into a laboratory. The sword piece\342\200\224this hilt\342\200\224would not budge from its resting place. The head of the troops, Gruppenf\303\274hrer Heinz Richter, would swear up and down the tunnels about this. It was all Doktor Straub could do to keep him from dynamiting the chapel into rubble. Those two... they were a bad combination.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_AUDIO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_ALOGS_KLAU_LOG09"}, 0x0800279533B6D4EFull},
			{{"He knew of our father, Marie. He had heard of how father's weapon designs had helped the Kaiserliche Marine. But he laughed... laughed that the brilliant Heinz Fischer had ended up making toys. I did not care to tell him that father had chosen to make toys as penitence\342\200\224to bring joy where before his invention had brought only death. I should have listened to father. I should have listened.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_AUDIO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_ALOGS_KLAU_LOG11"}, 0x088A781753762A65ull},
			{{"Straub was obsessed with the Hilt, with the strange physics rooting it to the mountain. Richter just wanted to make it into a weapon. From the very beginning they were at odds. This conflict brought about the ruination of everything... but also my first glimpse of hope.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_AUDIO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_ALOGS_KLAU_LOG13"}, 0x7861EE7F38A02944ull},
			{{"You see, Straub's focus was so all-encompassing that he missed some critical information\342\200\224information that was literally all around him. The chapel was more than just a resting place for this piece of the Emperor's legendary sword. It... well, it was like father always told us, Marie\342\200\224art tells a story. And in the carvings and statues surrounding the Hilt I uncovered a tale I had never expected.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_AUDIO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_ALOGS_KLAU_LOG14"}, 0x99D7D16B979469EEull},
			{{"Unfortunately, Straub came across a few of my notes on these... possibilities. He flew into a rage, and would only be mollified when I quoted his own words back to him: my work had been amateur, poorly documented. I was looking for more evidence. He went cold and left. It wasn't long after this that he started bringing stolen art into the bunker. You see, he had taken the root of my idea and run with it.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_AUDIO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_ALOGS_KLAU_LOG16"}, 0x25E778602B9098E8ull},
			{{"Marie, I cannot put this more succinctly: there are others... other forces aware of the Sword. Of its powers. And they are actively working to keep it out of our hands.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_AUDIO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_ALOGS_KLAU_LOG18"}, 0x8FF1A823B08D9557ull},
			{{"A secret organization, a cabal dedicated to keeping this hidden. Soldiers, artists, engineers\342\200\224I don't know how deep this goes. But Straub is now aware of this. You need to be aware as well.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_AUDIO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_ALOGS_KLAU_LOG19"}, 0x04DF8813E4A9613Aull},
			{{"That... that may be all I can share with you. Straub grows more suspicious of me every day. Dear sister, I have spent my time here preparing a way for you to defeat Straub and his evil. I have sabotaged his work. I have hidden weapons and tools that will give you the power to counter the horror that grows from beneath the mountain. My hope is that somehow... you can forgive me.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_AUDIO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_ALOGS_KLAU_LOG21"}, 0xDB5CFFD4E48C3F57ull},
			{{"I... I must go into hiding now\342\200\224I'm about to release Straub's most powerful weapon. I cannot promise that I will survive what happens next, but I pray it will open a way for you to find your way in to this nightmare. And if you do, I have no doubt that you will conquer it. This is your nature. And I will always admire this. I love you, Marie. Auf Wiedersehen.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_AUDIO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_ALOGS_KLAU_LOG22"}, 0x4EA4D40B81B1BC8Bull},
			{{"After our losses in the East, the F\303\274hrer has asked for something exceptional from my staff. Our leader says that Germany needs a new kind of soldier. A soldier who does not rest. A soldier who does not fear. And a soldier who does not shy away from the shadow of death.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG01_05"}, 0x87EC796F0E8F961Full},
			{{"I have found that soldier. Or, perhaps it is better to say that I have birthed him.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG01_06"}, 0xDAED07CD2491A32Eull},
			{{"But I am getting ahead of myself. After our losses in Egypt and Israel, I had begun to lose hope in our ability to find artifacts of significance\342\200\224those rare, legendary objects powerful enough to have left a mark on the history of mankind. But then, divine providence! The discovery of a lifetime\342\200\224within the very borders of the Vaterland, no less! Uncovered by humble German miners in the poor salt rock below the sleepy town of Mittelburg.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG01_07"}, 0x66A5ABFB56CE2E49ull},
			{{"The embodiment of German nobility. German Power. The undeniable German will. Even our F\303\274hrer admires this man, the man whose sword was said to have been held by the archangel Michael.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG01_10"}, 0xC88317E7A69C3863ull},
			{{"This is, of course, utter nonsense. But the Ahnenerbe was sent to reclaim the sword piece for Hitler's personal collection... and they could not move it. Not with chains, not with tractors, nothing. Some archaic force was confounding the might of German technology.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG01_11"}, 0xF90ABD0A0B3630A4ull},
			{{"That... that was not something that I requested... but who am I to refuse a battalion? We locked down this pastoral little hamlet and got to work. Little did we know that we were about to uncover something that would change our understanding of the world!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG01_14"}, 0xCD955D12160127C1ull},
			{{"More problems today than I have the patience to handle. Sometimes genius attracts resistance... attracts meddling fools\342\200\224like a verdammt magnet, I swear.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG02_01"}, 0x926AF048716E49DBull},
			{{"During one of my early experiments\342\200\224an attempt to draw power from the hilt\342\200\224a cable became overheated and snapped... it struck a pair of guards I had stationed at the doorway. They were killed instantly.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG02_13"}, 0x97943C4E9178A7DFull},
			{{"They were dead\342\200\224there was no question. One had been decapitated by the cable, the other had been disembowelled. Both of them fell to the floor and were motionless. And then they were not.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG02_14"}, 0x663E231A784D2A49ull},
			{{"As my assistants scrambled to disconnect the power, amidst all of the screams and commotion... I watched as the first soldier... his corpse began to twitch... violently... and then he stood! The headless man stood and then began walking towards me.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG02_15"}, 0xEC851EE5107B4FECull},
			{{"This... this Untote. This undead thing had no head\342\200\224and yet stumbled directly towards me. And then I noticed that its footsteps\342\200\224they matched syncopation with my own heartbeat. It was as though the energy that had killed this thing had transformed its skin into a hearing membrane. And the corpse's intent was clear: it meant to kill me.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG02_16"}, 0xC49A311FF9254747ull},
			{{"So I drew my pistol. I unloaded my entire weapon into the thing. Only after I had torn a... significant hole through its spine did this Untote drop to the ground. And then I saw the second one, lurching towards me\342\200\224with its intestines spilling down one leg.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG02_17"}, 0xEF09E1EDD0A23B7Bull},
			{{"Luckily, more soldiers had arrived by then and were able to put it down. But... I had seen something astonishing\342\200\224something unseen since the days of Lazarus. I had seen death overcome... and I had seen a vision of our F\303\274hrer's future!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG02_18"}, 0x6CD52CCC6241EDE7ull},
			{{"Ja, right. Geistkraft\342\200\224the name I have given this new form of energy. My theory is that the albedon\342\200\224a material combining iron, carbon, and magnetic monopoles\342\200\224actually breaches the boundaries of our universe into... other domains. In these dark places, the laws of physics are different.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG03_03"}, 0x688D226D00CF6E49ull},
			{{"I can bring the dead to life. The Geistkraft energy... it can be conducted through the human nervous systems, activating the most primitive parts of the human cerebellum.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG03_09"}, 0xB8BE8BDBA48158A1ull},
			{{"This is why I only use dead soldiers. They have a more... trained set of neural pathways in the hypothalamus that make obedience\342\200\224and violence\342\200\224easily accessible. The few villagers I experimented on were numb, confused, and recalcitrant. Those tests... they did not end well.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG03_10"}, 0x7B24A6172F73E57Full},
			{{"So! I create an active Geistkraft circuit in the undead body of soldier, and simple commands will trigger the lizard brain to pull on muscles, tendons, even punctured lungs.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG03_11"}, 0xDA96B6053F448C0Eull},
			{{"The Untoten are preserved by the same energy that drives them. They are machines now\342\200\224muscle and bones driven by loyalty to their master. Soldiers who do not breathe, or eat, or sleep. Soldiers who are driven by pain.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG03_13"}, 0x1E863469EDB1CDA4ull},
			{{"Yes, pain. I have found that by triggering the pain receptors on these corpses, I can augment the soldier's strength and speed. As someone who has... extensively studied the effects of pain... this was more than validating.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG03_14"}, 0x6842213A59CBE1C0ull},
			{{"And that bastard Richter... the man sent to assist my work, to protect my facility? He is only compounding the problem. He has been seduced by the power of the weapons we can build with the Geistkraft energy. He has taken over an entire wing of my laboratory and dedicated it to his foolish inventions! This has resulted in a weakened security perimeter in...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG04_03"}, 0xCA5678D047378889ull},
			{{"At least... at least until we understand it enough to regain control. Yes, to regain control.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG04_05"}, 0x72627B58204E934Bull},
			{{"The undead have... broken free. Four... no, five times now. They do not have any sort of intellect that is measurable\342\200\224not on an individual level. But as a group?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG04_06"}, 0x22131B7AB6FE8A33ull},
			{{"They grow quicker and more powerful with every attempt. I do not know if this is evidence towards some sort of shared consciousness\342\200\224a hive mind? Richter says that they are controlled by the hilt... by the incomplete piece of a dead man's sword.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG04_07"}, 0xAC522CC1EF9FE806ull},
			{{"That... is ridiculous. But one can only wonder at the power of the entire sword. It is no wonder that Barbarossa rose from his status as Duke to Holy Roman Emperor so soon... after finding this sword during the Crusades... a sword that he claimed to have been forged in Thule! I... I...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG04_08"}, 0x78886022B491EF36ull},
			{{"We are so close to mastery here. So close to building an army that can sweep across the frozen steppes of Russia... march across the English Channel\342\200\224or the Bering Strait\342\200\224without breaking stride! A tireless army that can rip the hearts from our enemies with cold, rotting fingers.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_VIDEO_LOGS_ZMB_NST01_VLOGS_STRA_LOG04_10"}, 0x02D43A34480C8BB1ull},
			{{"It tripped over its own foot. Er, feet. Feets. Ah, fuck if I know\342\200\224let's try and get that lid open.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_BRUTESTUNCOM_BOTH_MD"}, 0x50EBF70EB0279354ull},
			{{"I guess we need to keep... feeding this thing to keep it moving.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_CLAWMOVE_LO"}, 0x02CA6E1C2B2597E2ull},
			{{"I guess we need to keep... feeding this thing to keep it moving.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_CLAWMOVE_MD"}, 0x02CA6E1C2B2597E2ull},
			{{"Get away... GET AWAY FROM ME!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_FIREMANFEARREACT2_HI"}, 0x181D10B67E72D3C5ull},
			{{"Get away... GET AWAY FROM ME!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_FIREMANFEARREACT2_MD"}, 0x181D10B67E72D3C5ull},
			{{"Its head came clean off!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_FIREMANKILLED_HI"}, 0x105238B515A24F11ull},
			{{"Its head came clean off!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_FIREMANKILLED_MD"}, 0x105238B515A24F11ull},
			{{"What... what is making that sound?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_FIREMANSCREAMREACT_HI"}, 0x38FA9E9743D40ACCull},
			{{"What... what is making that sound?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_FIREMANSCREAMREACT_MD"}, 0x38FA9E9743D40ACCull},
			{{"... and I thought my childhood was messed up.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_FIRSTGATECLUE_REPLY_LO"}, 0x402EAAD67D46449Dull},
			{{"... and I thought my childhood was messed up.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_FIRSTGATECLUE_REPLY_MD"}, 0x402EAAD67D46449Dull},
			{{"Great, now we've done it\342\200\224the whole place is going arse up! Time to run.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_HILTROOMCOLLAPSE_BOTH_LO"}, 0x803514A16A719CC9ull},
			{{"Great, now we've done it\342\200\224the whole place is going arse up! Time to run.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_HILTROOMCOLLAPSE_BOTH_MD"}, 0x803514A16A719CC9ull},
			{{"Now I'm no scientist, but I've sold certain \"historically notable crystals\" before. They all have a unique ring to them, right? A resonance. Maybe the Nazis were buildin a gun to keep these ugly fucks in line... but didn't finish in time.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_JUICERINTRO_BOTH_LO"}, 0xA14ADA979C37412Bull},
			{{"These \"holy hands o' god\" pierced and propped up around the statue of a bloody emperor. Somebody was either worshipping Barbarossa... or mocking him.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_LEFTHANDALTARCLUE_LO"}, 0x4A28A2C5156D7F22ull},
			{{"These \"holy hands o' god\" pierced and propped up around the statue of a bloody emperor. Somebody was either worshipping Barbarossa... or mocking him.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_LEFTHANDALTARCLUE_MD"}, 0x4A28A2C5156D7F22ull},
			{{"Alright, now to turn this thing on.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_LEFTHANDALTARUBER3_HI"}, 0x5820B8F38823C067ull},
			{{"Alright, now to turn this thing on.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_LEFTHANDALTARUBER3_LO"}, 0x5820B8F38823C067ull},
			{{"Alright, now to turn this thing on.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_LEFTHANDALTARUBER3_MD"}, 0x5820B8F38823C067ull},
			{{"I have to repair the machine.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_LIGHTNINGRODBROKE_HI"}, 0x4258B02AA982AC42ull},
			{{"I have to repair the machine.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_LIGHTNINGRODBROKE_LO"}, 0x4258B02AA982AC42ull},
			{{"I have to repair the machine.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_LIGHTNINGRODBROKE_MD"}, 0x4258B02AA982AC42ull},
			{{"There's no power to raise this thing.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_LIGHTNINGRODMACHINE_HI"}, 0x2602B9AC2FC763D4ull},
			{{"This machine raises the lighting rods... but the power seems to be cut off.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_LIGHTNINGRODMACHINE_LO"}, 0x5CD8ECA55FBD0453ull},
			{{"The machine raises the lighting rods... but the power seems to be cut off.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_LIGHTNINGRODMACHINE_MD"}, 0xD78539EA04924C32ull},
			{{"Cutting it close, don'tcha think?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_MODREVIVED_REPLY"}, 0xDC35CF3782F3CCC0ull},
			{{"It's working! This is some sort of code!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_PAINTINGCODEREVEAL_HI"}, 0x9A5A07E2E9A97FC5ull},
			{{"It's working! This is some sort of code!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_PAINTINGCODEREVEAL_LO"}, 0x9A5A07E2E9A97FC5ull},
			{{"It's working! This is some sort of code!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_PAINTINGCODEREVEAL_MD"}, 0x9A5A07E2E9A97FC5ull},
			{{"Hmmm... no idea what's going on here. I knew I should have spent more time in church...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_RIGHTHANDALTARCLUE_BOTH_LO"}, 0x1F2D672F3BCB78D9ull},
			{{"Hmmm... no idea what's going on here. I knew I should have spent more time in church...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_RIGHTHANDALTARCLUE_BOTH_MD"}, 0x1F2D672F3BCB78D9ull},
			{{"Alright then\342\200\224let's go see if we've set anything on fire.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_RIGHTHANDALTARFINISH_BOTH_LO"}, 0x7422DB5240FBB8BCull},
			{{"Alright then\342\200\224let's go see if we've set anything on fire.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_RIGHTHANDALTARFINISH_BOTH_MD"}, 0x7422DB5240FBB8BCull},
			{{"This place is wired up like a bloody Christmas tree\342\200\224how did Barbarossa's lads know about electrical current in eleven-fuckin-hundred AD?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_RIGHTHANDALTAR_LO"}, 0x6F86BF453F210E96ull},
			{{"This place is wired up like a bloody Christmas tree\342\200\224how did Barbarossa's lads know about electrical current in eleven-fuckin-hundred AD?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_RIGHTHANDALTAR_MD"}, 0x6F86BF453F210E96ull},
			{{"Looks like we'll need to reroute the power to get through.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_SALTMINEDOOREXAMINE_HI"}, 0x52F2BFBE7E4C993Aull},
			{{"Looks like we'll need to reroute the power to get through.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_SALTMINEDOOREXAMINE_LO"}, 0x52F2BFBE7E4C993Aull},
			{{"Looks like we'll need to reroute the power to get through.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_SALTMINEDOOREXAMINE_MD"}, 0x52F2BFBE7E4C993Aull},
			{{"A generator! I need to find a way to get to it...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_SEEGENERATOR_LO"}, 0x9377D38F7A7608FAull},
			{{"A generator! I need to find a way to get to it...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_SEEGENERATOR_MD"}, 0x9377D38F7A7608FAull},
			{{"Spry little bugger, ain't he?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_SPRYLITTLEBUGGERAINTHE"}, 0x6911A8BD600EE69Bull},
			{{"You're running dry\342\200\224take this!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_DROS_SUPPLYAMMOMOD"}, 0x0EBD77BDAFC8C477ull},
