			{{"Get away... GET AWAY FROM ME!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_FIREMANFEARREACT2_MD"}, 0xA3F49380EE7BEE53ull},
			{{"Its head came clean off!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_FIREMANKILLED_HI"}, 0x105238B515A24F11ull},
			{{"Its head came clean off!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_FIREMANKILLED_MD"}, 0x105238B515A24F11ull},
			{{"What... what is making that sound?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_FIREMANSCREAMREACT_LO"}, 0x7211062F47BFCAF2ull},
			{{"Was that mortar shells? No... no, I know that sound. The tone is all wrong.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_FIRSTEARTHQUAKE_LO"}, 0x2DF9F386CAF0A8A7ull},
			{{"It's like a coffin... but built to keep the dead inside.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_FOLLOWERTANKLOOK"}, 0xADA303BE823FE5C9ull},
			{{"Back to the workbench... fast!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_FORGEPART_HI"}, 0xC40DCFB19AB2AF3Aull},
			{{"This kind of power\342\200\224in a weapon? It would make any army unstoppable.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_FORGESTARTUP2_LO"}, 0xBA4119260DB99B3Full},
			{{"The skull\342\200\224it's the monster's weak point!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_HEADSHOTMOD"}, 0xBF5EE3F064DF1FCBull},
			{{"A machine that renders the dead into crystals... crystals that carry the same... unholy power that drives these monsters?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_JUICERINTRO_BOTH_LO"}, 0xFCFFA89DA1D3B360ull},
			{{"Obviously the dwelling of a genius... [whispers] or a madman.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_KLAUSROOM_BOTH_LO"}, 0xBF33838077B575ABull},
			{{"The two energies seem to be... fighting... but nothing is happening.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_LEFTHANDALTARACTIVATED_LO"}, 0xD3F7C5CCE5D85AE8ull},
			{{"These sockets... Four swords were placed here, in ancient times. Is there a tie between them and the ravens?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_LEFTHANDALTARCLUE_LO"}, 0xEEFB71581DA7A40Aull},
			{{"I have to repair the machine.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_LIGHTNINGRODBROKE_HI"}, 0x4258B02AA982AC42ull},
			{{"I have to repair the machine.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_LIGHTNINGRODBROKE_LO"}, 0x4258B02AA982AC42ull},
			{{"I have to repair the machine.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_LIGHTNINGRODBROKE_MD"}, 0x4258B02AA982AC42ull},
			{{"This machine raises the lighting rods... but the power seems to be cut off.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_LIGHTNINGRODMACHINE_LO"}, 0x5CD8ECA55FBD0453ull},
			{{"This map\342\200\224it's shows how to bring power to the altars.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_MAPINTERACT"}, 0x52EB9B61341B226Cull},
			{{"This cursed fire\342\200\224I love returning it to those who birthed it.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_MODFREEFIRE"}, 0x9BCD27694A7939A5ull},
			{{"Remember, there's a mission. I need to conserve ammunition and stay focused on my objectives.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_NAGSTOPKILLING"}, 0xB92C9CC2C38A85D2ull},
			{{"It's working! This is some sort of code!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_PAINTINGCODEREVEAL_LO"}, 0x9A5A07E2E9A97FC5ull},
			{{"This artist... he must have been trying to hide something from the Nazis. They were on to him though... that must be why they were collecting these paintings.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_PAINTINGREVEAL_LO"}, 0x40ADB9C184342EB6ull},
			{{"Some of these artists... they would have hated the Nazis. They would have worked against them.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_PAINTINGTOUCH_LO"}, 0xF8318EA7E1C3C7D2ull},
			{{"Only the saints\342\200\224the pure in heart\342\200\224could stand at the Right Hand of God. The Left Hand was for those tainted with darkness.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_RIGHTHANDALTARCLUE_BOTH_LO"}, 0x4C0E59D66D2E017Full},
			{{"Those three altars below\342\200\224the Right Hand of God, the Left Hand of God, the Voice of God... what do they mean?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_RIGHTHANDALTARFINISH_BOTH_LO"}, 0xBDAED24625DFD81Full},
			{{"It's an archaic machine... and it needs power. A lot of power.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_RIGHTHANDALTAR_LO"}, 0x0614F1C27821B213ull},
			{{"This altar... it calls for pure energy from the heavens. Lightning. It would seem even the ancient builders knew the difference between good and evil.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_RIGHTHANDGODTOUCH"}, 0x9F4C64C87244B531ull},
			{{"The switch... it appears to be timed. I'll have to move more quickly.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_SALTMINERESET_LO"}, 0x20B452A380487A0Bull},
			{{"A generator! I need to find a way to get to it...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_SEEGENERATOR_LO"}, 0x9377D38F7A7608FAull},
			{{"A generator! I need to find a way to get to it...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_SEEGENERATOR_MD"}, 0x9377D38F7A7608FAull},
			{{"First pain... then elation. Nazi machinery that trades power for blood.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_VENDINGFIRSTTIME"}, 0xA68E1B1DFD5D3DF0ull},
			{{"Alright, that's all the notes... let's make some music!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_VOICEOFGODCODES_LO"}, 0xBC9AFF46965CEF64ull},
			{{"The sound... it's getting louder...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_VOICEOFGODCOMPLETE_HI"}, 0x5D8A76DF2A735AF7ull},
			{{"The sound... it's getting louder...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_VOICEOFGODCOMPLETE_LO"}, 0x5D8A76DF2A735AF7ull},
			{{"The sound... it's getting louder...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_VOICEOFGODCOMPLETE_MD"}, 0x5D8A76DF2A735AF7ull},
			{{"This looks like some sort of weapon... but it is missing some parts.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_WORKBENCHPART3_LO"}, 0x5A89DAE424FFE3C1ull},
			{{"The zeppelin\342\200\224it's back! Maybe I can get another battery...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_ZEPRETURNS_MD"}, 0x1703009570BC8310ull},
			{{"I need to watch where that lands\342\200\224could be useful.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_ZEPUBERDROP_MD"}, 0x22073C161009F1B3ull},
			{{"This... is heavier than it appears.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_ZEPUBERPICKUP_HI"}, 0x79160B2A0BB818FFull},
			{{"I have had to carry... heavier munitions than this. Across the alps. More weight.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_OLIV_ZEPUBERPICKUP_MD"}, 0xCCBCFD54D2DB6CA7ull},
			{{"This... is just a prototype. Stay put, little mice\342\200\224I'll return with the finished model.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_RICH_THISISJUSTAPROTOTYPESTAYP"}, 0x6D2E5F6F9EAA2B67ull},
			{{"Your arrival was... poorly timed. Our pets can be unpredictable, and Herr Straub was sloppy in his discipline. I will have to burn it all to the ground and start over.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_RICH_YOURARRIVALWASPOORLYTIMED"}, 0x47EE56350EECDBF2ull},
			{{"I've attuned our Elektroschnalle to repel die Untoten, Richter. But the panzerm\303\266rder is still loose. We need to get it back under our control AND YOU ARE FLYING AROUND IN YOUR VERDAMMT BALLOON!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_STRA_IVEATTUNEDOURELEKTROSCHNA"}, 0xDCEDE3DD9F54AE29ull},
			{{"That idiot Richter is still buzzing around in his toy instead of helping me\342\200\224I'll have to get rid of you vermin myself.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_NEST_01_ZMB_NST01_STRA_THATIDIOTRICHTERISSTILLBU"}, 0x37495B72C5CD9103ull},
			{{"Cutting it close, don'tcha think?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_SHIP_GLOBAL_ZMB_SHIP_GBL_DROS_MODREVIVED_REPLY"}, 0xDC35CF3782F3CCC0ull},
			{{"Spry little bugger, ain't he?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_SHIP_GLOBAL_ZMB_SHIP_GBL_DROS_SPRYLITTLEBUGGERAINTHE"}, 0x6911A8BD600EE69Bull},
			{{"You're running dry\342\200\224take this!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_SHIP_GLOBAL_ZMB_SHIP_GBL_DROS_SUPPLYAMMOMOD"}, 0x0EBD77BDAFC8C477ull},
			{{"I know a mark when I see one\342\200\224that fella's carryin the good stuff.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_SHIP_GLOBAL_ZMB_SHIP_GBL_DROS_TREASUREZOMBIESEEN"}, 0x278C7795E035D203ull},
			{{"Buggers must be off their tits\342\200\224they won't stay down... DEAD MEANS DEAD, YA GOBSHITES!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_SHIP_GLOBAL_ZMB_SHIP_GBL_DROS_WAVEDIFFICULTYCLUE_BOTH_LO"}, 0xA3FB1E7959141597ull},
			{{"Buggers must be off their tits\342\200\224they won't stay down... DEAD MEANS DEAD, YA GOBSHITES!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_SHIP_GLOBAL_ZMB_SHIP_GBL_DROS_WAVEDIFFICULTYCLUE_BOTH_MD"}, 0xA3FB1E7959141597ull},
			{{"Feeling... powerful...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_SHIP_GLOBAL_ZMB_SHIP_GBL_JEFF_BLITZPUNCH"}, 0x39EBBD6180F474B7ull},
			{{"It's like having my own damn guardian angel.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_SHIP_GLOBAL_ZMB_SHIP_GBL_JEFF_BLITZSHOCK"}, 0xAD1DE3C6CEFDA330ull},
			{{"Grrr... Stick to the mission, soldier. We're not here to put marks on our belt.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_SHIP_GLOBAL_ZMB_SHIP_GBL_JEFF_NAGSTOPKILLING"}, 0xCC719DF6FB117E1Bull},
			{{"My weapon\342\200\224it's firing energy instead of bullets!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_SHIP_GLOBAL_ZMB_SHIP_GBL_MARI_MODFREEFIRE"}, 0xFAE2420535EB4328ull},
			{{"Nothing to see here, mes amis!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_SHIP_GLOBAL_ZMB_SHIP_GBL_OLIV_CAMOUFLAGE"}, 0x0DF1665C660F7DD3ull},
			{{"The skull\342\200\224it's the monster's weak point!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_SHIP_GLOBAL_ZMB_SHIP_GBL_OLIV_HEADSHOTMOD"}, 0xBF5EE3F064DF1FCBull},
			{{"This cursed fire\342\200\224I love returning it to those who birthed it.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_SHIP_GLOBAL_ZMB_SHIP_GBL_OLIV_MODFREEFIRE"}, 0x9BCD27694A7939A5ull},
			{{"Remember, there's a mission. I need to conserve ammunition and stay focused on my objectives.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_SHIP_GLOBAL_ZMB_SHIP_GBL_OLIV_NAGSTOPKILLING"}, 0xB92C9CC2C38A85D2ull},
			{{"First pain... then elation. Nazi machinery that trades power for blood.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_SHIP_GLOBAL_ZMB_SHIP_GBL_OLIV_VENDINGFIRSTTIME"}, 0xA68E1B1DFD5D3DF0ull},
			{{"Hey, hier dr\303\274ben. Ich hab etwas geh\303\266rt.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_TRAINING_ZMB_TRAIN_GSLD1_HEYOVERHEREIHEARDSOMEONE"}, 0xACE6C6A8BE3F8DCBull},
			{{"Wir haben noch Zeit vor der n\303\244chsten Welle...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_TRAINING_ZMB_TRAIN_GSLD1_WEHAVETIMEBEFORETHENEXTWA"}, 0x02C64FD8D90F1B0Eull},
			{{"Wir sollten Zeit haben, bis die n\303\244chste Welle eintrifft. Achten Sie darauf, dass...", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_TRAINING_ZMB_TRAIN_GSLD1_WESHOULDHAVETIMEBEFORETHE"}, 0x31662D2EE152DFB0ull},
			{{"Halt! Wer bist... Was? Da ist noch einer!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_TRAINING_ZMB_TRAIN_GSLD2_HALTWHOAREWHATITSANOTHERO"}, 0x9D46B122B81B8332ull},
			{{"Is this a weapon? Klaus... his messages said that they had... strange devices here. He said that they could\342\200\224", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_TRAINING_ZMB_TRAIN_MARI_ISTHISAWEAPONKLAUSHISMESS"}, 0xA7A3F15BED5BEE8Full},
			{{"That soldier! He... he should not be alive.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_TRAINING_ZMB_TRAIN_MARI_THATSOLDIERHESHOULDNOTBEA"}, 0x1B518F1C8EA1C48Bull},
			{{"The Nazis use this energy from the dead... to unlock their arms cache. How... efficient.", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_TRAINING_ZMB_TRAIN_MARI_THENAZISUSETHISENERGYFROM"}, 0x059343624BACC326ull},
			{{"Wha\342\200\224!", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_TRAINING_ZMB_TRAIN_MARI_WHA"}, 0x15821202055659DEull},
			{{"What\342\200\224what was that thing?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_TRAINING_ZMB_TRAIN_MARI_WHATWASTHATTHING"}, 0x95075367AB326210ull},
			{{"What\342\200\224what happened?", "SUBTITLE_MP_ZOMBIE_TRAINING_ZMB_TRAIN_MARI_WHATWHATHAPPENED"}, 0xBF6F00877220E09Dull},
			{{"^GJefferson: ^WYeah, well the Russkies aren't ready for what's coming. Nobody is. We need to get off this ship and warn them.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_DLC2_LOAD_04"}, 0xD2FEF106949F1806ull},
			{{"^GDrostan: ^WYeah, if you think I'm ridin' a bullet down to Berlin, you've got another thing co\342\200\224", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_DLC2_LOAD_06"}, 0xEA169E6D09E200E8ull},
			{{"^GOlivia: ^WI'm out! Who's got a clip?", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_DLC2_OUTRO_01"}, 0x61583A7BB2F20845ull},
			{{"^GRideau: ^WClear me a path, folks. This is going to be a bumpy ride!", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_DLC2_OUTRO_04"}, 0xE4ADFF48CD80C76Aull},
			{{"^GDrostan: ^WAlright then, heid doon, everyone!", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_DLC2_OUTRO_05"}, 0x745EB58DE66DAE6Aull},
			{{"^GRideau: ^WThe horror of this new military force, a force composed entirely of the dead,", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_DLC3_LOAD_02"}, 0xB6DA9A49CF13AFE9ull},
			{{"^GRideau: ^WIt has fallen on us, the newly formed Bureau of Archaic Technologies,", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_DLC3_LOAD_04"}, 0x5440817BF46656D4ull},
			{{"^GDrostan: ^WVery subtle. Yeah, I don't need any more warning.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_DLC3_OUTRO_01"}, 0x8A8C7BAC447C658Aull},
			{{"^GDrostan: ^WWha... I mean... I recognize the pre-Byzantine characters but...", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_DLC3_OUTRO_11"}, 0x532DC5F674B6D7F3ull},
			{{"^GDrostan: ^WOh, hell, I couldna make head nor tails.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_DLC3_OUTRO_12"}, 0x09A3FA5468303F55ull},
			{{"^GRideau: ^WHave Captain Nguyen move her ships west and begin a search.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_DLC4_LOAD_05"}, 0x37F9218ABC58A634ull},
			{{"^GVivian: ^WSir? I... what is a sword going to do? We're outnumbered ten to one.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_DLC4_LOAD_07"}, 0xCB3D43504590109Dull},
			{{"^GRideau: ^WThat sword is the key to all this.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_DLC4_LOAD_08"}, 0xBFA2331A75589679ull},
			{{"^GRideau: ^WThe Nazis have opened the door to hell on earth,", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_DLC4_LOAD_09"}, 0xC305B5A143781E12ull},
			{{"^GJefferson: ^WStay close. Let's move, people.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_ISLAND_LOAD_17"}, 0x71EEC4EFD9FF5391ull},
			{{"^GOlivia: ^WShh, calme-toi.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_ISLAND_LOAD_20"}, 0xC2CE682F8FD43861ull},
			{{"^GDrostan: ^WI can't believe I'm saying this, but I wish we were back in Germany!", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_ISLAND_LOAD_22"}, 0xBF716ECCA5607EEAull},
			{{"^GJefferson: ^WWell, there goes the cavalry...", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_ISLAND_OUTRO_05"}, 0x25EC26264810DF20ull},
			{{"^GDrostan: ^WYeah, we've gone from bad to worse, mate.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_ISLAND_OUTRO_06"}, 0x798B294CF3902849ull},
			{{"^GOlivia: ^WNo. Something's wrong. We're not going to England. Straub has other plans.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_ISLAND_OUTRO_08"}, 0x9F1EFE3F8FA5B0B7ull},
			{{"^GJefferson: ^WBesides, these bastards had a Vermeer hangin\342\200\231 next to a Valkenburg.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_MP_ZOMBIES_TRAINING_LOAD_06"}, 0x66E53D4F86598F9Full},
			{{"^GRideau: ^WOlivia, your field work at Neuschwanstein led us to over 6,000 pieces stolen from private collectors in France.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_MP_ZOMBIES_TRAINING_LOAD_08"}, 0xBBDABC7E7745AA8Aull},
			{{"^GRideau: ^WAnd who can forget the Merkers Salt Mine\342\200\224", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_MP_ZOMBIES_TRAINING_LOAD_11"}, 0xCA11BFD29189DE8Bull},
			{{"^GDrostan: ^WYeah, yeah, I know what I did, but hold your applause.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_MP_ZOMBIES_TRAINING_LOAD_12"}, 0xEF23116E6DD6F712ull},
			{{"^GMarie: ^WTen days ago, we received a dossier.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_MP_ZOMBIES_TRAINING_LOAD_17"}, 0xF3737A7B9B304443ull},
			{{"^GMarie: ^WIn it, he provides the location of a hidden bunker...", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_MP_ZOMBIES_TRAINING_LOAD_19"}, 0xF5008171EB8B6725ull},
			{{"^GRideau: ^WEverything else is on a need-to-know basis.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_MP_ZOMBIES_TRAINING_LOAD_25"}, 0x2D645044C4FEDC89ull},
			{{"^GDrostan: ^WI'm in antiquities, darling, not search and rescue.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_MP_ZOMBIES_TRAINING_LOAD_33"}, 0xF3B95DCC68B30988ull},
			{{"^GJefferson: ^WWhat the hell was that\342\200\224", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_MP_ZOMBIES_TRAINING_LOAD_35"}, 0x725E075C0E624CB6ull},
			{{"^GDrostan: ^WI told you this was buggered\342\200\224Drostan told you!", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_MP_ZOMBIES_TRAINING_LOAD_36"}, 0x9449AE2C3277EB64ull},
			{{"^HStraub: ^WThe hilt to the legendary sword of the Holy Roman Emperor\342\200\224Frederick Barbarossa.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_ZOMBIE_STRAUB_VL01_09"}, 0xEB99A8C4BEE7022Aull},
			{{"^HStraub: ^WGerman power.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_ZOMBIE_STRAUB_VL01_101"}, 0x61F5F9F9204D589Eull},
			{{"^HStraub: ^WWhen the mountain will not come to\342\200\224", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_ZOMBIE_STRAUB_VL01_13"}, 0xE0CA37B5BC1DF606ull},
			{{"^HStraub: ^WEven without breaking through the magnetic force surrounding this hilt,", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_ZOMBIE_STRAUB_VL02_01"}, 0x9C0B139FAA174D3Aull},
			{{"^HStraub: ^WDuring one of my early experiments, an attempt to draw power from the hilt,", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_ZOMBIE_STRAUB_VL02_04"}, 0xBAE8B99D7C57BF50ull},
			{{"^HStraub: ^WThey were dead\342\200\224and then they were not!", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_ZOMBIE_STRAUB_VL02_07"}, 0xBA16EBFA511977A2ull},
			{{"^HStraub: ^WI watched as the first soldier began to twitch violently, and then began walking towards me.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_ZOMBIE_STRAUB_VL02_08"}, 0x71D93583BE785244ull},
			{{"^HStraub: ^WLuckily, more soldiers had arrived by then and were able to put it down.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_ZOMBIE_STRAUB_VL02_10"}, 0x907193641CAC401Bull},
			{{"^HStraub: ^WBut I had seen something astonishing.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_ZOMBIE_STRAUB_VL02_11"}, 0xE67897D61C0FA994ull},
			{{"^HStraub: ^WGeistkraft\342\200\224the name I have given this new form of energy.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_ZOMBIE_STRAUB_VL03_01"}, 0xDD249430709C81C1ull},
			{{"^HStraub: ^WIt can be conducted through the human nervous system,", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_ZOMBIE_STRAUB_VL03_02"}, 0x940E9D5BEA947C6Full},
			{{"^HStraub: ^WThe Untoten are preserved by the same energy that drives them.", "ZM_VIDSUBTITLES_ZOMBIE_STRAUB_VL03_04"}, 0xFA59BAE1DC10FBD5ull},
